# Files and folders listed here are NOT uploaded as public static assets.
#
# This Worker is deployed with assets.directory = "." (the repository root), so
# without this file the whole repository is downloadable from the live site —
# including /.git/config, /.git/index and /publish-worker/worker.js. Deleting a
# file from the repository is not enough: it stays on the live site until it is
# removed from the deployed asset bundle, which happens on the next deploy.
#
# Keep this list to repository internals only. index.html, basket.html,
# admin.html and menu.json must stay public.
.git/
.gitignore
.assetsignore
.dev.vars
.wrangler/
node_modules/
wrangler.jsonc
worker/
publish-worker/
README.md
